===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something left behind; an [[excess]] or [[remainder]].
#: {{ux|en|It's a '''leftover''' from yesterday, but it's still perfectly good.}}
# {{lb|en|chiefly|in the plural|usually|of food}} Remaining after a meal is complete or eaten for a later meal or snack.
#: {{ux|en|Not '''leftovers''' again!}}
#: {{ux|en|The entire wheel of cheese is a '''leftover''' from the party.}}

